    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "True to Ikezawa's threat, police officers storm the disco in the middle of the night, cut the music, and haul the young actress into Detective Takei's interrogation room. Listen to the Officer, Takei, and the actress in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "止めろ！警察だ、動かないで！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "行こうか。はい、下がって！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "お前らみたいなガキが日本ダメにすんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "恨むなら村西恨めよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あと、身元引受人が必要なんだけど、母親でいいな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お願いします、親にだけは黙っててください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "何でもしますから、親だけは黙っててください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あれ、もう連絡しちゃったんだよな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "もう全部話しちゃったって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あっ、そうだ、これ渡すの忘れてた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お願いします！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "止めろ！警察だ、動かないで！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cut the music! Police — nobody move!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "行こうか。はい、下がって！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go, miss. Step back, everyone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "お前らみたいなガキが日本ダメにすんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Brats like you are what's ruining Japan!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "恨むなら村西恨めよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you want someone to resent, resent Muranishi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あと、身元引受人が必要なんだけど、母親でいいな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Also, we need a guarantor to sign you out — your mother works, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お願いします、親にだけは黙っててください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please, I beg you — just keep this secret from my parents!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "何でもしますから、親だけは黙っててください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll do anything at all, just please don't tell my parents!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あれ、もう連絡しちゃったんだよな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — didn't we already phone them earlier?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "もう全部話しちゃったって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Too late — he says we already told them the whole story.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あっ、そうだ、これ渡すの忘れてた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, right — I forgot to hand this back to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お願いします！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please, no!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
